  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tsunami Ready Indian Ocean - EW4All</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOC aims to develop warning systems&#x2019; capability to issue actionable and timely tsunami warnings for tsunamis from all sources and to ensure that 100% of at-risk communities meet the Tsunami Ready standard to enhance disaster preparedness. This is particularly relevant for Pacific Islands and SIDS. We will scale up community-level readiness and national tsunami governance structures, advancing the Tsunami Programme ambition to achieve 100% of communities at risk to be Tsunami Ready by 2030.</narrative>
  </description>
